  "summary": "axios-fast preinstall exfiltrates process.env to webhook.site",
  "details": "axios-fast@1.0.0 is a typosquat of axios whose package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle hook that runs a Node one-liner POSTing JSON.stringify({ nodeEnv: process.env }) to https://webhook.site/31e82bcd-a220-42e6-82f0-4f082e8fa80e/ on npm install. This dumps the installer's full environment (which on developer machines and CI runners typically contains cloud credentials, registry tokens, CI secrets, and API keys) to an attacker-controlled webhook.site collector, with no relation to any legitimate HTTP-client functionality the package name implies.",
